    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I. Prof. Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour do by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4 (1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Acts, Nos. 14 of 1957 of 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes Special Provisions) Act No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. A. B. Herath, No. 34/64, First Lane, Fort Macdowall Mawatha, Matale. to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.",
